windows-11-style-clipboard-history-manager (2.5.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Activate live blocking CI/release (audit, deny, coverage, cargo test, SHA256SUMS, SPDX, SLSA).
  * Default build compiles without gif-search/reqwest; GIF commands stubbed.
  * Paste injection gated to the main window; paste ticket no longer a no-op.
  * Encrypted image files at rest; shared net_policy; expanded secret filter.
  * Per-window Tauri capabilities; tighter AppArmor /tmp rules.

