  * Split history_store / history_crypto from clipboard_manager.
  * Blocking cargo/npm audit in CI; SHA256SUMS on GitHub Releases.
  * Production hardening: paste tickets, Rust URL opener (no shell plugin),
    IPC payload truncation, SQLite WAL 0600 + secure_delete.
  * Installer verifies GitHub artifacts by default (no curl|sudo bash).

